WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:20.250
Phunziroli likusonyeza mmene mungayezere ana a maso.

00:00:35.233 --> 00:00:55.233
Vidiyoyi ikuyerekezera mayankho osiyanasiyana a ana a maso ku kuwala kolunjika.

00:01:10.465 --> 00:01:30.465
Zithunzi zapafupi zikuthandizani kuyerekezera maso onse awiri ndi mayankho awo.

00:01:45.698 --> 00:02:05.698
Khadi lomaliza likuwonetsa mfundo zikuluzikulu zoyezera.
